TITLE:: RCLayer
summary:: A layer of beats inside a song (the proto-library's beat_env)
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCBeat, Classes/RCSwing

DESCRIPTION::
Holds the clock, server, link::Classes/RCSwing:: and MIDI outputs shared by its beats, the live beats by name and the history of every beat name ever created. A beat with the same name replaces (frees) the previous one.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: addBeat
Create, register and play a beat (the proto-library's code::make_beat_from_dict::).
argument:: name
argument:: attrDict
Key/value array (order matters) or Event.
argument:: chan
MIDI channel.
argument:: midiOut
Defaults to the layer's.
argument:: seeds
nil: the song seed for every streamed key; code::\none::: unseeded; a number; an Array by position; a Dictionary by key with code::\default::.
argument:: addFirst
Pairs evaluated before the dur pipeline.
argument:: addFirstSeeds
argument:: terminationKey
The beat frees itself when this key's pattern ends.
argument:: quant
argument:: post
returns:: the link::Classes/RCBeat::

